//
// This pass eliminates redundant load/store pairs generated by the spill
// register expansion. After ExpandPostRAPseudos, the code often contains
// patterns like:
//   std 4,u        ; store D to spill slot
//   ldd 4,u        ; reload D from same slot (D unchanged → redundant)
//
// The pass tracks which registers hold values from which stack slots and
// eliminates loads that are provably redundant.
//
//===----------------------------------------------------------------------===//

